<http://data.silknow.org/object/750fc987-b5d9-3790-9b50-b141f6f2d9a9/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Fragment of silk brocaded in polychrome silks on a grayish-green satin ground. Chinoiserie design of two different scenes of two men in a boat, one a rowboat and the other a sailboat.  Fantastic trees and flowers, frogs, butterflies.  Composed of a number of fragments.  Pencil lines along edges.  Soiled, stained, worn, blacks rotted out, holes.  On part of one side a twill selvedge.  Held together in places with white basting stitches."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/750fc987-b5d9-3790-9b50-b141f6f2d9a9> .

